      "id": "bbc-2026-11-23-biggest-u-turn-in-economic-history-experts-react-to-jensen-h",
      "title": "'Biggest U-turn in economic history': Experts react to Jensen Huang's return to Nvidia",
      "summary": "The Nvidia CEO was reinstated after weeks of controversy over his affair with an alleged Chinese spy.",
      "body": "Nvidia's board members have announced that they unanimously voted to reinstate Jensen Huang as the company's boss \"effective immediately\" - capping a remarkable U-turn in the technology firm's fortunes.The board had previously ruled out Huang's return after he admitted an affair with a woman who was alleged to be a Chinese spy.US President Donald Trump praised the decision, telling CNBC he made it happen, while Nvidia's share price shot up by more than 30% after a week of poor performance in the wake of the initial scandal.Experts from across the techonology and business sector reacted to his unexpected return.Read the BBC's analysis of Huang's reinstatement.",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "business",
      "tags": [],
      "author": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T18:43:00.000Z",
