      "title": "Apple’s AirPods Pro 3 are 40 percent off ahead of Black Friday",
      "summary": "AirPods Pro 3 | Photo by Amelia Holowaty Krales / The Verge\t\n\nThe AirPods Pro 3 are cheaper than ever. Apple’s latest flagship wireless earbuds dropped this morning to just $149 at Amazon, Best Buy and Walmart. Originally, they sold for $249, but have been commonly available for $199 outside the range of deal events. The best price that we’ve previously seen was $169, which is what they’re current",
      "body": "The AirPods Pro 3 are cheaper than ever. Apple’s latest flagship wireless earbuds dropped this morning to just $149 at Amazon, Best Buy and Walmart. Originally, they sold for $249, but have been commonly available for $199 outside the range of deal events. The best price that we’ve previously seen was $169, which is what they’re currently selling for at Best Buy.\nIt’s a weird situation that, right now, the feature-packed AirPods Pro 3 are the same price as the newer (but less impressive) AirPods 5 that include the wireless charging case. The Pro 3 deliver considerably more bang for your buck.\n[Product: AirPods Pro 3 | https://www.amazon.com/Apple-Cancellation-Translation-Headphones-High-Fidelity/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FAirPods-nbsp-Pro-nbsp-3%2F17835006350, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-airpods-pro-3-wireless-active-noise-cancelling-earbuds-with-heart-rate-sensing-feature-white%2FJJGCQLYK5F]\nThis model is Apple’s best-sounding, longest-lasting AirPods, and they ship with five silicone ear tips. Compared to the second-gen AirPod Pro, these offer better water resistance (IP57 versus IP54), longer battery life per charge (eight hours versus six), improved noise cancellation, and heart rate sensing through built-in sensors. The case also has Apple’s second-gen Ultra Wideband chip in the case.\nRead our AirPods Pro 3 review.",
