      "summary": "You've got $50 to spend on a friend or loved one this shopping season, and you're not sure what to spend it on. First off, that's actually really generous of you. While this price tier can sometimes be challenging to shop for - caught between affordable accessories and big-ticket items - there's plenty of gold to be mined for clever shoppers. And we're here to help.\nThis guide includes a wide rang",
      "body": "You’ve got $50 to spend on a friend or loved one this shopping season, and you’re not sure what to spend it on. First off, that’s actually really generous of you. While this price tier can sometimes be challenging to shop for — caught between affordable accessories and big-ticket items — there’s plenty of gold to be mined for clever shoppers. And we’re here to help.\nThis guide includes a wide range of cool finds at $50 or less, from mainstream hits like KPop Demon Hunters on Blu-ray and popular tech like the DJI Mic Mini to more eccentric picks like VidaBay’s E Ink fridge magnets and the Werewolf USB-C power adapter. We think you’ll be surprised how far your $50 can stretch.\n[Product: Epilogue GB Operator | https://www.epilogue.co/product/gb-operator]\n[Product: OhSnap Grip Stand | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fohsnap-grip-stand-magnetic-phone-grip-with-multi-angle-portrait-kickstand-magsafe-compatible-for-iphones-universal-gator-fade%2FJ3GW23L8VL, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fohsnap-grip-stand-magnetic-phone-grip-with-ultra-thin-portrait-stand-black%2F-%2FA-95004697, https://ohsnap.com/products/snap-grip-stand?variant=45669680709823]\n[Product: Wacaco Minipresso GR2 | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D52XSWKB?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.wacaco.com/products/minipresso-gr2]\n[Product: Train on the Island (vinyl) | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GPY9DCTD?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FAldous-Harding-Train-On-The-Island-VINYL-LP%2F19730718334, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Faldous-harding-train-on-the-island-vinyl-lp%2FJJ8LVY3RTH]\n[Product: Zepath USB-C batteries | https://www.amazon.com/Zepath-Rechargeable-Batteries-Capacity-12Pack-3000mWH/dp/B0DDXN6SSP?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Shelly Camera | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.skimresources.com%3Fid%3D87443X1797501%26xs%3D1%26url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fus.shelly.com%252Fproducts%252Fshelly-camera-black%253Fvariant%253D54812279832917]\n[Product: Moft Invisible Laptop Stand | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4X6M9NF?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.skimresources.com%3Fid%3D87443X1797501%26xs%3D1%26url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.moft.com%252Fproducts%252Finvisible-stand%253Fvariant%253D41489878646871]\n[Product: Werewolf VFLEX Starter Kit Lite | https://werewolf.us/collections/werewolf-products/products/vflex-starter-kit]\n[Product: Hoto 12-in-1 electric screwdriver | https://www.amazon.com/HOTO-Screwdriver-Electric-Cordless-Shadowless/dp/B08Z74BLX9?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Big Walk | https://store.playstation.com/en-us/product/UP3971-PPSA33764_00-WALKWALKWALKWALK/, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nintendo.com%2Fus%2Fstore%2Fproducts%2Fbig-walk-switch-2%2F]\n[Product: Hobonichi Techo planner | https://www.1101.com/store/techo/en/2027/pc/detail_cover/ob27_jan_en/]\n[Product: SwitchBot Bot button pusher | https://www.amazon.com/Switchbot-Switch-Button-Pusher-Bluetooth/dp/B07B7NXV4R?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.switch-bot.com%2Fproducts%2Fswitchbot-bot, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQPWD5BT/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: iFixit Pro Tech Go Toolkit | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DD96HCNK?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fifixit-pro-tech-go-toolkit-advanced-set%2FJ3GWLLVW24%2Fsku%2F6593509, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homedepot.com%2Fpep%2FiFixit-Pro-Tech-Go-Multi-Bit-Driver-Toolkit-with-Screwdriver-IF145-783-1%2F338782106]\n[Product: EasySMX S10 Lite | https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F