JJGCQP6SG7]\n[Product: LeapFrog My First Gamer | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GN243YB9?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FLF-MY-1ST-GAMER%2F18889423740, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fleapfrog-my-first-gamer%2F-%2FA-94990947]\n[Product: Paleblue USB-C rechargeable batteries | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H2N6V9TH?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fpaleblueearth.com%2Fproducts%2Fvoyager-aa-rechargeable-batteries]\n[Product: Knockaround Premiums sunglasses | https://www.amazon.com/Knockaround-Premiums-Polarized-Sunglasses-Protection/dp/B01C6843QK/?tag=theverge02-20, https://knockaround.sjv.io/c/482924/3768094/48003?u=https%3A%2F%2Fknockaround.com%2Fproducts%2Fpremiums%3Fvariant%3D43114998726761]\n[Product: D&D Stranger Things: Welcome to the Hellfire Club | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FFKL233T?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Carrera Mario Kart RC car | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YRY5465?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Ikea Iskarna | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fp%2Fiskaerna-led-table-lamp-multicolor-90510403%2F]\n[Product: Saiji nonslip leather lap desk | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T5YBJH1?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: 8BitDo FlipPad controller | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HHHRVWLL?tag=theverge02-20]",
