      "body": "SEARCH | USER PAGES |\nThe Spirit of the Night\nNyx, the world's oldest Internet Service Provider,\nis a free public-access ISP that\na full, uncensored Usenet newsfeed,\nLinux shell accounts and the usual Unix/linux programming and development\nThere is no setup fee or monthly cost required to have a Nyx account,\nthough tax-deductable contributions are always appreciated. Nyx Net is a\n501(c)(3) nonprofit organization entirely run by volunteers and supported by\n... Not much happening recently of note (knock on wood!) ... here's the history...\nWe've done various system updates that have changed the system's SSH host key, as well a\ns what algorithms are permitted. If you see things relating to that, don't panic.\n*** !! NYX NEEDS -YOU- !! ***\nSSH: Available for validated users.\nNyx NetP.O.Box 16143 Golden, CO 80402\nwith questions or comments about this web site.\nCopyright © 1999 - 2020 Nyx Net\nNyx® is a registered trademark of Nyx Net, a",
