      "id": "theverge-2026-11-22-some-of-our-favorite-switch-2-games-are-cheaper-through-blac",
      "title": "Some of our favorite Switch 2 games are cheaper through Black Friday",
      "summary": "This ain’t gonna buff out.\t\n\nBlack Friday is a great time to expand your game library because it’s a chance to catch deals that aren’t normally happening throughout the year. That’s true for Nintendo Switch 2 games, as well. In addition to a $50 off sale on one of its console bundles, Nintendo is also knocking $20 off some of the Switch 2’s best titles. Some of the most notable games include Donke",
      "body": "Black Friday is a great time to expand your game library because it’s a chance to catch deals that aren’t normally happening throughout the year. That’s true for Nintendo Switch 2 games, as well. In addition to a $50 off sale on one of its console bundles, Nintendo is also knocking $20 off some of the Switch 2’s best titles. Some of the most notable games include Donkey Kong Bananza, which is $49.99 (usually $69.99) at Amazon, Target, and Best Buy, and Super Mario Party Jamboree Plus Jamboree TV for $59.99 (usually $79.99) at Amazon, Walmart, and Best Buy.\nAmazon, Best Buy, Walmart, and GameStop are offering discounts on several more Switch 2 games, though their respective end times and availability varies. Nintendo shared that some game sales will end on November 29th. Even if deals dry up for physical games on your wishlist, digital game deals are happening through Nintendo’s eShop until 11:59 PM PT on Wednesday, December 2nd, 2026.\n[Product: Metroid Prime 4: Beyond | https://www.amazon.com/Metroid-PrimeTM-Beyond-Nintendo-SwitchTM-Switch/dp/B0FQXR2NPH?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fmetroid-prime-4-beyond-nintendo-switch-2%2FJ7GSL5JFV6%2Fsku%2F6646359, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fmetroid-prime-4-beyond-nintendo-switch-2%2F-%2FA-1011679879]\n[Product: Donkey Kong Bananza | https://www.amazon.com/Donkey-Kong-Bananza-Nintendo-Switch-2/dp/B0F66KLYVH?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fdonkey-kong-bananza-nintendo-switch-2%2FJ7GSL5JFFJ%2Fsku%2F6414108, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fdonkey-kong-bananza-nintendo-switch-2%2F-%2FA-94694203]\n[Product: The Legend of Zelda: The Ocarina of Time | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJ6JP36P//?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Super Mario Party Jamboree Plus Jamboree TV | https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FSuper-Mario-Party-Jamboree-Nintendo-Switch-2-Edition-Jamboree-TV-U-S-Version%2F15920303652, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fsuper-mario-party-jamboree-nintendo-switch-2-edition-jamboree-tv-nintendo-switch-2%2FJ7GSL5JVYY, amazon.com/Super-Mario-PartyTM-Jamboree-Nintendo-Switch/dp/B0F66JNF9W?th=1&psc=1]\n[Product: EA Sports FC 27 | https://www.amazon.com/Standard-Nintendo-Switch-Cartridge-VideoGame-2/dp/B0H9SZBQVQ?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nintendo.com%2Fus%2Fstore%2Fproducts%2Fea-sports-fc-27-switch-2%2F]\n[Product: Monster Hunter Wilds | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nintendo.com%2Fus%2Fstore%2Fproducts%2Fmonster-hunter-wilds-switch-2%2F]\n[Product: Kirby and the Forgotten Land Plus Star-Crossed World | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nintendo.com%2Fus%2Fstore%2Fproducts%2Fkirby-and-the-forgotten-land-nintendo-switch-2-edition-plus-star-crossed-world-switch-2%2F]\n[Product: EA Sports Madden NFL 27 | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nintendo.com%2Fus%2Fstore%2Fproducts%2Fea-sports-madden-nfl-27-switch-2%2F]\n[Product: RuneScape: Dragonwilds Deluxe Edition | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nintendo.com%2Fus%2Fstore%2Fproducts%2Frunescape-dragonwilds-deluxe-edition-switch-2%2F]\n[Product: Orbitals: Deluxe Edition | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=87443X1797501&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nintendo.com%2Fus%2Fstore%2Fproducts%2Forbitals-deluxe-edition-switch-2%2F]\n[Product: Star Wars Outlaws: Gold Edition | https://www.amazon.com/Star-Wars-Outlaws-Gold-Nintendo-Switch/dp/B0F79Z9V31?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Elden Ring: Tarnished Edition | https://www.amazon.com/ELDEN-RING-Tarnished-Nintendo-