      "id": "bbc-2026-11-21-zelensky-says-putin-is-a-killer-after-trump-calls-russian-pr",
      "title": "Zelensky says Putin is a 'killer' after Trump calls Russian president a friend",
      "summary": "Trump's comments came as Russia launched \"biggest attacks this year\" against Ukraine.",
      "body": "Zelensky called the attack the \"biggest this year\" and said the country suffered civilian deaths and injuries after an onslaught of 110 missiles, including 27 ballistic, and more than 400 drones.Hours after the strikes on Ukraine, Trump told reporters at the White House that Putin would \"love to end the war\".\"They (Zelensky and Putin) both want to end it and it's a very good thing I have a relationship,\" he said on Friday.Trump also doubled down on his description of the Russian leader as a friend but said he \"can't speak\" to whether Putin is a friend to the US.However Zelensky said despite Trump's stance, he saw Putin as \"a killer\".\"I think mostly for the people in the world, he is a killer because he's killing - by the way- he's killing each day and night,\" he said.Zelensky also said speaking about Putin like he is a \"friend\" means \"he doesn't feel enough pressure\". The war of words came as Poland said a Russian cruise missile was among three objects that violated its airspace early on Friday.Polish Prime Minister Donald Tusk said it did not appear to be an accident when Western military exercises were taking place in the region.Nobody was hurt and no damage has been reported, but Warsaw described the incident as a \"provocation\" from Moscow.",
