      "id": "bbc-2026-11-20-gta-6-sales-hit-3-8bn-in-a-single-day-the-biggest-entertainm",
      "title": "GTA 6 sales hit $3.8bn in a single day - the biggest entertainment launch in history",
      "summary": "The mammoth figure surpasses every video game launch and single-day film box office record.",
      "body": "Grand Theft Auto 6 (GTA 6) saw record retail sales in its first full-day of release, hitting $3.8bn (£2.9bn), making it the biggest entertainment launch in history.Take-Two, the parent company of Rockstar Games, said on Friday the figures were based on estimates through end of day on Thursday and marked a record for \"entertainment across any medium\". It pre-sold 32.5m copies of the game. To compare, Spider-Man: Brand New Day, this year's highest-grossing film so far, made $2.5bn (£1.8bn) over its entire run in cinemas. Internet infrastructure firm Cloudflare said earlier that PS5 downloads in the UK peaked at 8.6 times normal levels around its launch.New Zealand, where GTA 6 was first available, saw a 14.8-fold spike four hours before, suggesting some players switched regions for early access.In its initial findings since the game's launch, Cloudflare also recorded a huge surge in traffic to Rockstar's online services, peaking at 11.2 times normal levels in Australia and 9.3 times on the US East Coast. In Europe, UK interest was particularly strong, reaching seven times normal levels compared with 5.3 times in France and Germany.The record smashes that of its predecessor - from 13 years prior - Grand Theft Auto V. The game previously held the best opening week sales in video-game history, earning $1.15bn (£1.2bn) in just five days.The game is the latest instalment in Rockstar's nearly three decade old crime simulator franchise, which has become one of the most popular games in history.At its core, the series is a satirical take on the American dream, putting players in the shoes of career criminals in Leonida, the game's Florida-inspired state.The latest release follows new characters, a pair of small-time criminals Lucia and her partner Jason.GTA 6 is estimated to have cost more than $1bn to develop, which would make it the most expensive video game in history.",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
      "author": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:53:24.000Z",
