      "body": "Up Next. Who is taking part in France's recent street protests? Video, 00:01:42SubsectionEuropePublished7 hours ago'Danger seems greater all the time': Ukrainians search for missing after Russian strikes. Video, 00:01:47SubsectionEuropePublished18 hours agoWhat's next after no deal at COP31 climate talks? Video, 00:01:05SubsectionWorldPublished11 hours agoWhat the new UK-EU deal could mean for future post-Brexit relations. Video, 00:01:42SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoWes Streeting calls Putin a 'cold-blooded killer' as he meets Zelensky in Kyiv. Video, 00:01:40SubsectionWorldPublished2 days agoCost of living protests sweep across Europe. Video, 00:01:08SubsectionEuropePublished3 days agoMiami or Vice City? Tour the real-world inspiration for GTA 6. Video, 00:01:35SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoWhat the Brussels summit could mean for the UK-EU Brexit deal. Video, 00:00:50SubsectionEuropePublished3 days agoBBC correspondents discuss what Trump, Xi and Putin got out of historic talks. Video, 00:02:02SubsectionWorldPublished3 days agoRohingya genocide: What was said in court and what happens now? Video, 00:01:15SubsectionAsiaPublished3 days ago'You can be believed and understood': Joanne Young speaks after verdict. Video, 00:03:07SubsectionUKPublished4 days ago",
