      "id": "bbc-2026-11-20-thousands-join-cost-of-living-protests-across-europe",
      "title": "Thousands join cost of living protests across Europe",
      "summary": "Student-led protests have swept across Europe in response to the rising cost of living, housing shortages and underfunded education.",
