      "id": "hackernews-2026-11-19-two-stealth-models-just-appeared-on-the-leaderboard-both-ahe",
      "title": "Two stealth models just appeared on the leaderboard, both ahead of Fable 5.2",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://contralabs.com/frontierdesign\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50558559\nPoints: 63\n# Comments: 17",
      "body": "Exploring the frontier of AI design capabilities through real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace, golden designs and model comparisons.\n© 2026 Contra Labs × BenchFlow\nLeaderboardHow frontier models rank in blind head-to-head votes on real client briefs from Contra’s marketplace.\nElo rating from blind head-to-head votes\nGestaltHuman goldenClaude Fable 5.2Claude Opus 5.5GPT-6.1 SolClaude Sonnet 5.5Kimi K3.1 ProGPT-6 AstraQwen3.8 MaxKimi K3GLM-5.3 PrimeGemini 4 CarbonMuse Spark 1.3Muse WonderGrok 4.7Gemini 4 ArgonDeepSeek V4 Pro\nReal design projects, judged by designers and scored by rubrics\nFrontier Design Benchmark is the first benchmark built on real world, high value, and complex design projects. It is judged by professional designers in the Contra Labs network, ensuring the quality of evaluation.\nIn the benchmark, we also built a design critique rubric and a list of AI slop patterns. The rubric scores are highly correlated with the designers’ ratings of the models (r = 0.94). These additional metrics provide explainable design quality judgement on top of pairwise preferences.\nGolden GalleryReal client briefs, each with its golden: the design set beside the models’ outputs as the bar.",
