        "Tech"
      ],
      "author": "Jay Peters",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T01:39:45.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/04/STK022_ELON_MUSK_CVIRGINIA_C.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0%2C9.9676601489831%2C100%2C80.064679702034&w=1200",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/1037448/elon-musk-ukraine-starlink-starshield-nyt-dealbook",
