      "id": "theverge-2026-11-18-the-best-early-black-friday-deals-you-can-already-shop",
      "title": "The best early Black Friday deals you can already shop",
      "summary": "The countdown to Black Friday is on, and the discounts are starting to appear. Although the shopping holiday isn’t officially until November 27th, retailers are already dropping early deals on some of our favorite tech. Of course, with prices rising across the board, a good discount doesn’t necessarily mean you’re getting a historically low price. But we’re still seeing worthwhile discounts on a h",
      "body": "The countdown to Black Friday is on, and the discounts are starting to appear. Although the shopping holiday isn’t officially until November 27th, retailers are already dropping early deals on some of our favorite tech. Of course, with prices rising across the board, a good discount doesn’t necessarily mean you’re getting a historically low price. But we’re still seeing worthwhile discounts on a host of tried-and-tested gear, with more expected next week.\nBelow, we’ve rounded up the best early Black Friday deals we’ve found so far. Prices could drop further as Black Friday approaches, as is always the case, but these deals are worth considering if you’d rather shop early and beat the holiday rush. We’ll continue to update this guide as more retailers launch their holiday sales, too, so be sure to check back regularly as we get closer to the main event.\n[Product: AirPods Pro 3 | https://www.amazon.com/Apple-Cancellation-Translation-Headphones-High-Fidelity/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FAirPods-nbsp-Pro-nbsp-3%2F17835006350, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-airpods-pro-3-wireless-active-noise-cancelling-earbuds-with-heart-rate-sensing-feature-white%2FJJGCQLYK5F]\n[Product: Sony DualSense Wireless Controller | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FY6Y9WZT?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fsony-playstation-5-dualsense-wireless-controller-midnight-black%2FJXHQ37T9XC, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fdualsense-wireless-controller-for-playstation-5%2F-%2FA-83377785]\n[Product: 007 First Light | https://store.playstation.com/en-us/product/EP3969-PPSA11386_00-007FIRSTLIGHT000]\n[Product: Amazon Fire TV Stick 4K Plus | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F7Z4QZTT?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Famazon-fire-tv-stick-4k-plus-newest-model-ai-powered-fire-tv-search-wi-fi-6-streaming-device-8-gb-free-live-tv-black%2FJ39TLS6QVZ%2Fsku%2F6644638]\n[Product: Apple Watch Series 12 | https://www.amazon.com/Apple-Watch-Smartwatch-Black-Aluminum/dp/B0HJ9YNRW7?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FApple-Watch-Series-12-GPS-42mm-Dark-Bronze-Aluminum-Case-with-Olive-Sport-Band-S-M%2F20989411427, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-watch-series-12-gps-42mm-aluminum-case-with-sand-sport-band-s-m-light-gold-2026%2FJJGCQP9FS8%2Fsku%2F6572730]\n[Product: Philips Hue Essential four-pack of bulbs | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FMGP1P6W/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fphilips-hue-essential-starter-kit-white-and-color-ambiance%2FJ7GHXKHVYR%2Fsku%2F6639200, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FMGR8TGB?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Fanttik S1 Pro Cordless Electric Screwdriver | https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0C141QZVL/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Nothing Ear 3A earbuds | https://www.amazon.com/Nothing-Ear-3a-Cancelling-Recording/dp/B0GZW1BYJF/?th=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2F1234567890%2F20138215272, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fnothing-ear-3a-wireless-bluetooth-in-ear-earbuds-white%2FCZTTGJQH7G%2Fsku%2F6686088]\n[Product: MacBook Neo | https://www.amazon.com/Apple-2026-MacBook-13-inch-Laptop/dp/B0GR685V9X?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2F13-inch-macbook-neo-apple-a18-pro-chip-with-6core-cpu-and-5core-gpu-8gb-memory-256gb-ssd-silver%2FJJGCQYXSYR, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR6F79MT/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[