      "body": "Your books, on a reader you can make your own. CrossPoint is free software for compact e-readers, built by the people who read on them.Buying through our shop links helps fund development.Join the thousands of readers who love CrossPointMore control over how you read.CrossPoint is the software behind the screen. Free to install, with new features built by people who use it every day.EPUB formatting and typographyRead EPUBs with justified text, language-aware hyphenation, and working footnotes. CrossPoint also renders drop caps, small caps, and illustrations.Read the reading guide →Custom fonts and page layoutChoose your typeface, size, margins, and line, word, and letter spacing. Convert a font you own with our font builder, or load TrueType fonts directly on readers with external RAM.Set up custom fonts →Library search and sortingBrowse every book on your SD card. Search by title or author, and sort by recent reads, title, or author.Read the library guide →Wi-Fi transfers, Calibre, and OPDSDrop a book into your browser or send it from Calibre. Browse OPDS and OPDS 2.0 catalogs on the reader. Away from home? Load books through its own Wi-Fi hotspot.Get books onto your reader →Highlights, bookmarks, and reading syncHighlight a passage, save a clipping, or name a bookmark. Quick Resume takes you straight back into your book, and KOReader sync keeps your place across devices.Use highlights and clippings →Offline dictionariesLook up a word or a whole phrase without leaving your book. Add a StarDict dictionary and use it offline, wherever you’re reading.Add a dictionary →Multilingual and right-to-left textCommunity translations, right-to-left text, and hyphenation rules that follow the language of your book. Indic scripts aren’t supported yet.Explore language support →Focus Reading and page-turn controlsTry Focus Reading for a guided pace. On supported hardware, turn pages with a tilt or set up your own tap and swipe gestures.Set up Focus Reading →Bluetooth page turnersPair a compatible Bluetooth remote to turn pages without touching your reader. Assign short and long presses to page turns, chapter navigation, the reader menu, or clipping selection.Pair your remote in Settings → Connectivity → Bluetooth Page Turner, then choose what each button does.Buy on Amazon Set up a Bluetooth page turner →contributors around the world242contributors around the worldcommunity forks built on CrossPoint1,947community forks built on CrossPointchanges in the last major release126changes in the last major releasedevices running CrossPoint281,736devices running CrossPointFind the readerthat fits your pocket.Compare devices CrossPoint SyncReading progress across devicesKeep your place across CrossPoint and KOReader devices. View your current books, finished reads, and reading stats in the app.Search and share highlightsFind saved passages across your books, copy clippings as Markdown, or share a passage as an image.Connect your reading servicesUpdate your shelves and progress on Hardcover, send highlights to Readwise, or sync your place with BookFusion and Audiobookshelf.Your next read starts here.",
