      "id": "bbc-2026-11-18-police-investigate-death-of-boy-3-after-nursery-incident",
      "title": "Police investigate death of boy, 3, after nursery incident",
      "summary": "The boy died in hospital three days after an incident at Cosy Toes Nursery in Middleton, police say.",
      "body": "A spokeswoman for Cosy Toes said they were \"all heartbroken\" by the \"wonderful and beautiful\" boy's death.\"Our thoughts and prayers are all with his family at this terrible time,\" she said.\"We will of course give our fullest possible assistance in every way possible to the enquiries that must rightly follow this tragic event.\"Anyone with information about the boy's death is being urged to contact police.Brennan said: \"We are in the very early stages of our involvement and are carefully considering events and the evidence available to us. \"For now, we ask that the family's privacy is respected as they begin to navigate the unimaginable loss of their little boy.\" Ofsted said it had taken the decision to suspend the nursery's registration in the wake of the incident, meaning the nursery will be closed for six weeks as investigations are carried out.A spokesperson said: \"Our thoughts are with the family of the young boy and everyone affected by this deeply distressing and tragic incident.\"We have worked closely with the police, and we have suspended the nursery's registration. We will continue to support the police and other agencies in their enquiries. We are unable to comment further while the police investigation is ongoing.\"",
