      "id": "bbc-2026-11-18-watch-marco-rubio-says-recent-tech-outages-are-completely-un",
      "title": "Watch: Marco Rubio says recent tech outages are 'completely unrelated' to one another",
      "summary": "Microsoft, major US banks, Apple and Air Traffic authorities have been hit over recent days by tech glitches.",
      "body": "Recent tech outages across the US are \"completely unrelated\" to one another, US Secretary of State Marco Rubio has said.Microsoft outlook went down for nearly an entire day, a tech glitch briefly grounded all flights in the US and major American banks reported system issues all in the space of several days.The secretary said there is \"zero evidence\" of a link between the recent cyber incidents.Rubio spoke to media in the Philippines' capital Manila, where he is joining US President Donald Trump on a major foreign event attending the Asean and Apec summits, where he is expected to meet with the leaders of China and Russia.Read more on this story here.",
