      "id": "bbc-2026-11-17-bbc-reports-from-kyiv-bridge-hit-by-russian-attack",
      "title": "BBC reports from Kyiv bridge hit by Russian attack",
      "summary": "The BBC's Sarah Rainsford spoke to residents near the site of the overnight strike.",
      "body": "Russian strikes hit two key bridges in Kyiv, with Mayor Vitaliy Klitschko saying the Ukrainian capital had suffered \"damage to critical infrastructure systems\" and disruption to heating and water supplies overnight.Elsewhere, images shared by President Volodymyr Zelensky showed a missile approaching Crimean Bridge. Zelensky said it was an \"unprecedented operation\" weeks in the making.Built by Russia after it invaded and illegally annexed Ukraine's southern peninsula in 2014, the bridge was personally opened by Putin in 2018.The BBC's Southern and Eastern Europe correspondent, Sarah Rainsford, has this report from one of the bridges hit by Russia in Kyiv.Read more about the overnight attacks in Kyiv and Crimea.",
