      "id": "bbc-2026-11-16-prince-and-princess-of-wales-arrive-in-india-ahead-of-meetin",
      "title": "Prince and Princess of Wales arrive in India ahead of meeting with Modi",
      "summary": "Most of the engagements the royal couple will attend are related to the Earthshot Prize, which Prince William founded.",
      "body": "The Prince and Princess of Wales have arrived in India for a three-day visit that will include a meeting with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi.The visit is the first time William and Catherine have been on an official overseas trip together in four years.Her cancer treatment has limited the amount of international travel she has undertaken but she will be with her husband for several engagements this week. Most are related to the Earthshot Prize, founded by Prince William, which awards five £1m prizes for the best solutions to the biggest climate challenges.\"The princess is enormously proud of what the prince has achieved with Earthshot and is really looking forward to being alongside him for what is one of the most important moments in his year,\" said a spokesperson for the royals. \"She's seen it develop into something truly remarkable and is excited to experience first-hand just how far it has come.\"The meeting with Modi was a late addition to the royal schedule after the Indian prime minister confirmed he would be back from a scheduled trip to the Philippines in time to see the royals. They will fly from Mumbai to New Delhi for the meeting on Wednesday.\"For the Prince, it represents another significant engagement as he continues to take on a growing role on the international stage,\" a Kensington Palace spokesperson said. \"We've seen him increasingly support the UK's diplomatic relationships through his overseas engagements, and this meeting will provide an opportunity to build on those connections at the highest level.\"The couple last met Modi on their official visit to India in 2016.",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "world",
      "tags": [],
      "author": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-16T02:53:15.000Z",
